        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Brass 10 Inch Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHigh quality solid brass door pull that is not too plain, but not too fancy. This is our one of our best selling shower door pulls. Available in your choice of 5 finish colors.  The 10 Inch Back to Back Shower Door Pulls are packaged with all the hardware for back to back mounting (pulls hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. Requires minimum 3/8\" diameter hole in glass. The 10\" Decorative Door Pull is 1\" diameter with a 2-1/2\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2575-Specifications.gif?v=1704354549\" width=\"432\" height=\"135\" border=\"0\" atl=\"DWD-SD-DP2575 Back-to-Back 10 Inch C-Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-back-to-back-shower-door-pulls-sd-dp2574\"><b>8 Inch Shower Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the DWD-SD-DP2575 Glass Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 10\" </li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Mount: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Back to Back Glass Door Kit</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SD-DP2575.pdf?v=1704262234\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-SD-DP2575 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</i>\r\n</p>",
