                "description": "10 Inch Shower Door Back to Back Pulls, DWD-SD-DP2575 - High quality solid brass door pull that is not too plain, but not too fancy. This is our one of our best selling shower door pulls. Available in your choice of 5 finish colors. The 10 Inch Back to Back Shower Door Pulls are packaged with all the hardware for back to back mounting (pulls hook to each other) on 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower doors. The 10 inch Decorative Door Pull  has a 1 inch diameter with a 2-1/2 inch projection.",
